{"id":"f5777491ee5f9532","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-top7-first-category-set.md","title":"ZFC Top7 First Category Set","display":"df-zfc-top7-first-category-set — ZFC Top7 First Category Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top7-first-category-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top7-first-category-set"],"display":"df-zfc-top7-first-category-set — ZFC Top7 First Category Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-top5-meagre-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top7-first-category-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top7-first-category-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top7-first-category-set — ZFC Top7 First Category Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e224bb32227a0f8\" href=\"?note=0e224bb32227a0f8\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-top5-meagre-set.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-top5-meagre-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,A\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5MeagreSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5MeagreSet}_S\\)</span>（第一纲／贫集谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0e224bb32227a0f8\" href=\"?note=0e224bb32227a0f8\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-top5-meagre-set.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-top5-meagre-set.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop7FirstCategorySet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop7FirstCategorySet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（本原子的兼容谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}first\\text{-}category\\text{-}set}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop7FirstCategorySet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5MeagreSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}first\\text{-}category\\text{-}set}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop7FirstCategorySet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5MeagreSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“第一纲集”与“贫集（meagre set）”是同一概念；规范上游谓词已验证拓扑，并使用真正的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-序列覆盖。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-top5-meagre-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"0e224bb32227a0f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-top5-meagre-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-top5-meagre-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"0e224bb32227a0f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5MeagreSet}_S$（第一纲／贫集谓词，见 [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-top5-meagre-set.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5MeagreSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop7FirstCategorySet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}first\\text{-}category\\text{-}set}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop7FirstCategorySet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5MeagreSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":983,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3630","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-top7-first-category-set.md|58-df-zfc-top7-first-category-set]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","0e224bb32227a0f8"]}